### Response Format:

**If the method CANNOT return null at this specific call site:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[EXPLAIN WHY THE INVOCATION BlockNode exitEnd = BlockUtils.followEmptyPath(exit) RESULT CANNOT BE NULL.]]></reason>
  <value>NO</value>
</response>
```

**If the method CAN return null at this specific call site:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[EXPLAIN WHY THE INVOCATION BlockNode exitEnd = BlockUtils.followEmptyPath(exit) RESULT CAN BE NULL.]]></reason>
  <value>YES</value>
</response>
```

**If you need declarations of other methods to make a determination:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[Explain why you need these method declarations to make a confident decision]]></reason>
  <success>false</success>
  <methods>
    <method>methodName</method>
  </methods>
